      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i'm on warfarin for my heart and just checked my lab portal... my inr is way up at 4.6 which is scary. i really dont want to have to go to the hospital tonight if i can help it, is there a way i can just take some extra vitamin k or something at home to bring the number down before i call my doctor in the morning?",
